{"unit_id":"hulibuld__dsh-get-it-for-free#card-zh","repo":"hulibuld/dsh-get-it-for-free","commit":"a24356e6e212445c4923cb6de0e1aec7344cb0df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Get It For Free 是 DSH 的网页端模型接入插件，用账号授权方式把多个免费模型渠道接入模型选择器。它注册可用与地区受限两类模型 provider，并提供网页设置页管理账号和模型。用户可以查看模型可用性、同步模型目录、管理渠道模型开关，并查看本机按渠道和模型统计的用量。适合希望在 DSH 中集中使用多个免费模型渠道的用户；需要按所选渠道完成相应账号登录，设置和状态保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:459-473","client.js:4913-4919","src/store.js:23-27"]}
{"unit_id":"hulibuld__dsh-get-it-for-free#card-en","repo":"hulibuld/dsh-get-it-for-free","commit":"a24356e6e212445c4923cb6de0e1aec7344cb0df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Get It For Free connects free model channels to DSH with account sign-in. It registers usable and region-limited model providers and adds a web management page. Users can check availability, refresh catalogs, toggle models, and view local usage by channel and model. Settings are stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:459-473","client.js:4913-4919","src/store.js:23-27"]}
